%% Figure 3.X — Human-in-the-Loop SOC Workflow
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client Browser
    participant P as Reverse Proxy<br/>(port 8999)
    participant ML as ML Pipeline
    participant AQ as Alert Queue
    participant IC as Incident Correlator
    participant D as SOC Dashboard
    participant A as SOC Admin

    C->>P: HTTP Request
    P->>P: Enforcement Check (O(1))

    alt Fingerprint Blocked
        P-->>C: HTTP 403 Blocked
    else Not Blocked
        P->>ML: process_http_request()
        ML->>ML: Feature Extraction (35 feat, ~2ms)
        ML->>ML: Stage 1: Isolation Forest (~10ms)

        alt Anomaly Detected (score ≥ 0.40)
            ML->>ML: Stage 2: XGBoost (~20ms)
            ML->>ML: Stage 3: FP Reducer (~5ms)
            ML->>ML: Decision Engine (<1ms)
            ML-->>AQ: Add Alert (PENDING_ADMIN_ACTION)
            AQ->>IC: Correlate (IP|attack_type, 5min)
            AQ-->>D: Push Alert to Dashboard
            D-->>A: Display Alert + XAI Trace

            A->>AQ: POST /resolve → BLOCK
            AQ->>P: Add fingerprint to block set
            Note over P: Future matching requests<br/>blocked at O(1) middleware

            A->>AQ: POST /resolve → ALLOW
            Note over AQ: Override index updated<br/>Future same-pattern → skip

            A->>AQ: POST /resolve → IGNORE
            Note over AQ: Alert archived
        else Normal Traffic (score < 0.40)
            ML-->>P: Decision: IGNORE
        end

        P->>P: httpx forward to Moodle (:80)
        P-->>C: Moodle Response
    end
